IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXEOD.

*> Pix settlement end-of-day driver.  Composes the existing cycle,
*> settlement and clearing services for the current business date.
*> Every step is restart-safe: completed steps replay as no-ops.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT STL-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS SR-STL-ID OF STL-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD STL-FILE.
01 STL-REC.
   COPY "BPXSTLR".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   COPY "BDATP".
   COPY "BPXCFG".
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-CYCLE-ID PIC X(20).
01 WS-STATUS PIC X(16).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-FILE-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-I PIC 9(05).
01 WS-ZERO-STL.
   05 WZ-BIZDATE PIC 9(08) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-SETTLE PIC 9(08) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-GROSS PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-GROSS-RCV PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-ADJ PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-FEE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-NET PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-SETTLED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-TXN PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-PAY PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-RCV PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-PARTY PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-ITEM PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-ATT PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-PAY PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-RCV PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-SPENT PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-GETD PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-PEND PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
   05 WZ-POS-NET PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.

01 WS-ROWS PIC 9(07).
01 WS-SETTLED PIC 9(07).
01 WS-POSTED PIC 9(07).
01 WS-EXC-CNT PIC 9(07).
01 WS-PEND-CNT PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TXN-CNT PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
01 WS-N-IDS PIC 9(05) VALUE 0.
01 WS-ID-MAX PIC 9(05) VALUE 200.
01 WS-IDS.
   05 WS-STL-IDS OCCURS 200 TIMES.
      10 WS-STL-ID PIC X(12).
      10 WS-SSTAT PIC X(16).
      10 WS-SPOST PIC X(12).

LINKAGE SECTION.
   COPY "BPXSLP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-MSG
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    IF WS-CFG-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO SL-RC
        MOVE "BUSINESS DATE UNAVAILABLE" TO SL-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "BPXCFG" USING BK-PX-CFG
    IF PC-STATUS NOT = "00" OR PC-ENABLED NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "PIX SETTLEMENT DISABLED" TO SL-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-BIZDATE
    IF SL-CURRENCY = SPACES
        MOVE PC-CURRENCY TO SL-CURRENCY
    END-IF
    MOVE "BATCH" TO SL-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-CORR
    IF SL-REQUEST = SPACES
        MOVE "EOD-PIX" TO SL-REQUEST
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-ROWS WS-SETTLED WS-POSTED WS-EXC-CNT WS-PEND-CNT
    PERFORM CLEAR-PARMS-NUMERIC
    PERFORM STEP-ACCRUE
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-COUNT END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-CLOSE END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-CALC END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-SUBMIT END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-RESULTS END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-POSTS END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-POSITIONS END-IF
    IF SL-RC = "00" PERFORM STEP-FINALIZE END-IF
    PERFORM SUMMARIZE
    GOBACK.

CLEAR-PARMS.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE WZ-BIZDATE TO SL-BIZDATE
    MOVE WZ-SETTLE TO SL-SETTLE-DATE
    MOVE WZ-GROSS TO SL-GROSS-AMT
    MOVE WZ-GROSS-RCV TO SL-GROSS-RCV
    MOVE WZ-ADJ TO SL-ADJ-AMT
    MOVE WZ-FEE TO SL-FEE-AMT
    MOVE WZ-NET TO SL-NET-AMT
    MOVE WZ-SETTLED TO SL-SETTLED-AMT
    MOVE WZ-TXN TO SL-TXN-COUNT
    MOVE WZ-PAY TO SL-PAY-COUNT
    MOVE WZ-RCV TO SL-RCV-COUNT
    MOVE WZ-PARTY TO SL-PARTY-COUNT
    MOVE WZ-ITEM TO SL-ITEM-COUNT
    MOVE WZ-ATT TO SL-ATTEMPTS
    MOVE WZ-POS-PAY TO SL-POS-PAYABLE
    MOVE WZ-POS-RCV TO SL-POS-RECEIVABLE
    MOVE WZ-POS-SPENT TO SL-POS-SPENT
    MOVE WZ-POS-GETD TO SL-POS-RECEIVED
    MOVE WZ-POS-PEND TO SL-POS-PENDING
    MOVE WZ-POS-NET TO SL-POS-NET.

CLEAR-PARMS-NUMERIC.
    MOVE 0 TO SL-BIZDATE SL-SETTLE-DATE SL-GROSS-AMT SL-GROSS-RCV
        SL-ADJ-AMT SL-FEE-AMT SL-NET-AMT SL-SETTLED-AMT
        SL-TXN-COUNT SL-PAY-COUNT SL-RCV-COUNT SL-PARTY-COUNT
        SL-ITEM-COUNT SL-ATTEMPTS SL-POS-PAYABLE SL-POS-RECEIVABLE
        SL-POS-SPENT SL-POS-RECEIVED SL-POS-PENDING SL-POS-NET.

STEP-ACCRUE.
    MOVE "ACCRUE" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-ACCRUE-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    CALL "BPXCYC" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    IF SL-RC = "22"
        MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
    END-IF
    IF SL-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SL-CYCLE-ID TO WS-CYCLE-ID.

STEP-COUNT.
    PERFORM RESET-PARMS
    MOVE "CYCLE-GET" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-COUNT-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    CALL "BPXCYC" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE SL-TXN-COUNT TO WS-TXN-CNT
    MOVE SL-CYCLE-STATUS TO WS-STATUS
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC.

STEP-CLOSE.
    PERFORM RESET-PARMS
    MOVE "CYCLE-CLOSE" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-CLOSE-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    CALL "BPXCYC" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC.

STEP-CALC.
    PERFORM RESET-PARMS
    MOVE "CYCLE-CALCULATE" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-CALC-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    CALL "BPXCYC" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC.

STEP-SUBMIT.
    PERFORM RESET-PARMS
    MOVE "CYCLE-SUBMIT" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-SUBMIT-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    CALL "BPXSTL" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC.

STEP-RESULTS.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-N-IDS
    PERFORM COLLECT-ROWS
    IF SL-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-N-IDS
        IF WS-SSTAT(WS-I) = "SUBMITTED" OR
           WS-SSTAT(WS-I) = "UNKNOWN"
            ADD 1 TO WS-ROWS
            PERFORM CLEAR-PARMS
            MOVE "STL-RESULT" TO SL-OP
            MOVE WS-STL-ID(WS-I) TO SL-STL-ID
            MOVE "BATCH" TO SL-OPERATOR
            MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-CORR
            STRING "EOD-R-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-STL-ID(WS-I)
                DELIMITED SIZE INTO SL-REQUEST
            END-STRING
            CALL "BPXSTL" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
            IF SL-RC = "00"
                IF SL-STL-STATUS = "SETTLED" OR
                   SL-STL-STATUS = "RECONCILED"
                    ADD 1 TO WS-SETTLED
                ELSE
                    ADD 1 TO WS-PEND-CNT
                END-IF
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO WS-EXC-CNT
            END-IF
            MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

APPLY-ONE-RESULT.
    CONTINUE.

STEP-POSTS.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-N-IDS
    PERFORM COLLECT-ROWS
    IF SL-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-N-IDS
        IF (WS-SSTAT(WS-I) = "SETTLED" OR
           WS-SSTAT(WS-I) = "RECONCILED") AND
           WS-SPOST(WS-I) NOT = "POSTED" AND
           WS-SPOST(WS-I) NOT = "NOT-REQUIRED"
            PERFORM CLEAR-PARMS
            MOVE "STL-POST" TO SL-OP
            MOVE WS-STL-ID(WS-I) TO SL-STL-ID
            MOVE "BATCH" TO SL-OPERATOR
            MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-CORR
            STRING "EOD-P-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-STL-ID(WS-I)
                DELIMITED SIZE INTO SL-REQUEST
            END-STRING
            CALL "BPXSTL" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
            IF SL-RC = "00"
                ADD 1 TO WS-POSTED
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO WS-EXC-CNT
            END-IF
            MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.



STEP-POSITIONS.
    PERFORM CLEAR-PARMS
    MOVE "POSITION-REBUILD" TO SL-OP
    MOVE "BATCH" TO SL-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-CORR
    CALL "BPXSTL" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE "00" TO SL-RC.

STEP-FINALIZE.
    PERFORM RESET-PARMS
    MOVE "CYCLE-FINALIZE" TO SL-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-FINALIZE-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    CALL "BPXSTL" USING BK-PX-STL-PARMS
    MOVE SL-CYCLE-STATUS TO WS-STATUS
    IF SL-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
    END-IF.

RESET-PARMS.
    PERFORM CLEAR-PARMS
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-BIZDATE
    MOVE "BATCH" TO SL-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO SL-CORR
    MOVE SPACES TO SL-REQUEST
    STRING "EOD-PIX-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO SL-REQUEST
    END-STRING.

COLLECT-ROWS.
    PERFORM OPEN-STL-INPUT
    IF SL-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ STL-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM STORE-ROW
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE STL-FILE.

STORE-ROW.
    IF SR-CYCLE-ID NOT = WS-CYCLE-ID
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-N-IDS >= WS-ID-MAX
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO WS-N-IDS
    MOVE SR-STL-ID TO WS-STL-ID(WS-N-IDS)
    MOVE SR-STATUS TO WS-SSTAT(WS-N-IDS)
    MOVE SR-POST-STATUS TO WS-SPOST(WS-N-IDS).

OPEN-STL-INPUT.
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxstl.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-PATH
    OPEN INPUT STL-FILE
    IF WS-FILE-ST = "35"
        MOVE "00" TO WS-FILE-ST
        MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-FILE-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO SL-RC
        MOVE "PIX SETTLEMENT STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO SL-MSG
    END-IF.

SUMMARIZE.
    MOVE WS-CYCLE-ID TO SL-CYCLE-ID
    MOVE WS-STATUS TO SL-CYCLE-STATUS
    MOVE WS-TXN-CNT TO SL-TXN-COUNT
    MOVE WS-ROWS TO SL-ITEM-COUNT
    MOVE WS-SETTLED TO SL-PAY-COUNT
    MOVE WS-POSTED TO SL-RCV-COUNT
    MOVE WS-PEND-CNT TO SL-PARTY-COUNT
    MOVE WS-EXC-CNT TO SL-ATTEMPTS
    IF SL-RC = SPACES
        MOVE "00" TO SL-RC
    END-IF
    STRING "PIX CYCLE " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CYCLE-ID)
        DELIMITED SIZE " STATUS " DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STATUS)
        DELIMITED SIZE " OBLIGATIONS " DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-ROWS DELIMITED SIZE " SETTLED " DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-SETTLED DELIMITED SIZE " POSTED " DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-POSTED DELIMITED SIZE " FAILURES " DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-EXC-CNT DELIMITED SIZE INTO SL-MSG
    END-STRING.
